OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785062907
OL,3,CMan jailed for five years over #2.4m
OL,4,Ccompany fraud
OL,6,FA man's been given a five-year jail
OL,7,Fsentence for defrauding an electronics
OL,8,Fmanufacturer out of more than #2.4m.
OL,10,F33 year old Connor O'Brien from Kings
OL,11,FLynn in Norfolk was a financial
OL,12,Fdirector at Living Optics in Abingdon.
OL,13,FHe was suspended after irregularities
OL,14,Fwere spotted within the company's
OL,15,Faccounting system. He pleaded guilty
OL,16,Fat Oxford Crown Court to two counts of
OL,17,Ffraud by abuse of position.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
